# Overview

Make one atomic, replayable deoptimization of the current kernel: remove one
optimization actually present in its code, preserve the operator contract, and
emit a SKILL.md explaining the removed optimization.
If the input is already naive, skip deoptimization.

The input kernel is: {{ input_kernel | tojson }}

Given artifacts are read-only; your current working directory holds this step's
outputs. Preserve the complete input problem, including its numerical requirements.

You need to produce the deoptimized kernel in this directory layout in the action working directory:

```text
kernel.json                 # Complete simplified kernel
submission/                 # Complete simplified source bundle
SKILL.md                    # One forward optimization, using the SkillCard schema below
evaluations/                # Self-check evidence
```

